flowchart LR
    A[Discovery queue state] --> B[Current Kodi playlist]
    B --> C[Backlog: keep up to 10 previous items]
    B --> D[Current item]
    B --> E[Future buffer: keep about 10 items ahead]

    D --> F{Future remaining < threshold?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Pick random songs from Kodi library]
    G --> H[Append items at playlist end]
    H --> E
    F -- No --> I[No refill needed]

    D --> J{Backlog > 10?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Remove old items from top]
    K --> L[Adjust stored current position]
    J -- No --> M[Keep playlist unchanged]

    N[Manual skip] --> O[Player.GoTo current+1]
    O --> P[Update state immediately]
    P --> D

    Q[Automatic excerpt elapsed] --> R[Service Player.GoTo next]
    R --> P
